<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page qd-theme qd-diary"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="heading">轻轻运动</view><view class="subtitle">{{date}} · 记录轻轻动起来的自己</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><view class="empty">登录后查看自己的运动记录</view><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go">登录 / 完善资料</button></view><block wx:else><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">每一步，都算数</text><button class="link" data-url="/pages/exercise/index?date={{date}}" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>＋ 记运动</text></button></view><view class="card"><view class="row"><view class="row start"><image class="inline-icon" src="/images/ui/walk.svg"/><text class="title">这天的运动</text></view><text class="small-text">{{records.length}} 次 · {{totalMinutes}} 分钟</text></view><view wx:if="{{!records.length}}" class="meal-empty">散步、拉伸，也是一份小小的坚持。</view><view wx:for="{{records}}" wx:key="id" class="record-row"><view class="grow"><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small-text">{{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.exerciseKcal ? item.exerciseKcal+' 千卡' : '消耗未估算'}}</view></view><button class="delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view></view><view class="footnote">运动记录与当天日记、轻动计划任务同步。</view></block></block></view>
